{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Keep remote exports out of checkpoint callbacks**\n\n`onOperationChange` runs while checkpoint processing still holds its polling lock and before pollers complete. Calling synchronous S3/CloudWatch export and flush here can stall durable progress or cause invocation timeouts; late RUNNING exports may also overwrite the terminal S3 record. Queue/coalesce immutable snapshots here, drain them from awaited `onInvocationEnd`, and add a delayed-exporter race test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7sNyUF","finding_digest":"bc70e659378e613de7bdb3b2633e5192cc833438fddfe77f4a591b9e4288a471","finding_id":"arf_v1_xryomwjxrzqt3z55wozggpsrsl","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::insightplugin.emit::checkpoint-hook-blocking","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::insightplugin.emit::checkpoint-hook-blocking","line":151,"observation_digest":"e4c5dbe0bd2db76eaa8e9d89de280efe14eb403999442ce770f7d50aef1422cc","observation_id":"aro_v1_4tc5xyf5fw3w5kuotwe54kao7y","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/WorkflowInsight.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_xryomwjxrzqt3z55wozggpsrsl","published_at":"2026-09-08T23:03:32Z","review_id":"arr_v1_iee7bcnfj7lcytdfodx5mvljjs","reviewed_base_sha":"730f534832656d1da8a3205f5468595ffb05f33d","reviewed_head_sha":"ce1de5fa37a2da2f6805802585eeee8390944531","reviewer":"codex","start_line":151,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_6yyo6rhynw4jniiwuom2wwcjyz","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-08T23:03:32Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
